---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import PageHeader from '@/components/ui/PageHeader.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---
<Page
  title="Disclaimer — CloudAlgo"
  description="Disclaimer for CloudAlgo's website and consulting services."
>

  <PageHeader
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Disclaimer' }]}
    title="Disclaimer"
    lead={`Last updated: ${lastUpdated}`}
  />

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container legal-container">

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Website Information</h2>
        <p>
          The information provided on <strong>cloudalgo.com</strong> (the "Site") is for general informational
          purposes only. While CloudAlgo makes every effort to keep the information accurate, complete, and
          up to date, we make no representations or warranties of any kind — express or implied — about the
          completeness, accuracy, reliability, suitability, or availability of the information, products,
          services, or related graphics on the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any reliance you place on such information is therefore strictly at your own risk.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>No Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>
          Content on this Site is not intended to constitute professional legal, financial, or technical
          advice. The blog articles, case studies, and guides published on this Site reflect the
          opinions and experience of the authors and are provided for educational purposes only.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before making any business or technology decision based on content found on this Site,
          we recommend consulting with a qualified professional. CloudAlgo is happy to provide a
          formal consultation — <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Salesforce & Third-Party Products</h2>
        <p>
          CloudAlgo is an independent Salesforce consulting partner. We are not affiliated with,
          endorsed by, or officially connected with Salesforce.com, Inc., Heroku, MuleSoft, or any
          other third-party product referenced on this Site, beyond our status as an authorized
          Salesforce consulting partner.
        </p>
        <p>
          All product names, logos, brands, and trademarks mentioned on this Site are the property
          of their respective owners. Reference to any products, services, processes, or other
          information by trade name, trademark, manufacturer, or otherwise does not necessarily
          constitute or imply our endorsement, recommendation, or favouring by CloudAlgo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event will CloudAlgo, its directors, employees, partners, agents, or affiliates be
          liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising
          from your use of this Site or reliance on any information contained herein, even if
          CloudAlgo has been advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our total liability for any claim related to the Site shall not exceed the amount paid by
          you to CloudAlgo in the 12 months prior to the claim, or USD $100, whichever is greater.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <p>
          This Site may contain links to external websites operated by third parties. These links
          are provided for convenience only. CloudAlgo has no control over the content of those
          sites, and we accept no responsibility for them or for any loss or damage that may arise
          from your use of them.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Technical Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Code samples, configuration examples, and technical tutorials published on this Site are
          provided as-is. They are intended as illustrative examples only. You should thoroughly
          test any code or configuration in a sandbox environment before deploying to production.
          CloudAlgo accepts no liability for data loss, org corruption, or service disruption
          arising from the use of technical examples on this Site.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to update this Disclaimer at any time without prior notice.
          Changes become effective immediately upon posting to the Site. Your continued use of
          the Site constitutes your acceptance of the updated Disclaimer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Disclaimer, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="legal-contact">
          <strong>CloudAlgo</strong><br/>
          115, Irish, Manglam Aananda, Jaipur, India<br/>
          <a href="mailto:contact@cloudalgo.com">contact@cloudalgo.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Page>

<style>
.legal-body {
  background: var(--surface-card);
  padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
}
.legal-container {
  max-width: 720px;
}
.legal-section {
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  padding-bottom: 3rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default);
}
.legal-section:last-child {
  border-bottom: none;
  margin-bottom: 0;
  padding-bottom: 0;
}
.legal-section h2 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.legal-section p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--color-text);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.legal-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.legal-section a {
  color: var(--color-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}
.legal-section a:hover { opacity: 0.6; }
.legal-contact {
  background: var(--surface-page);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-top: 1rem;
}
.legal-contact a {
  color: var(--color-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
}
</style>
